{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":42,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["流落異鄉者的禱告"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["可拉後裔作的訓誨詩，交給樂長。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"上帝啊，我的心切慕你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像鹿切慕溪水。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我心裡渴慕上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"渴慕永活的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我何時才能去朝見祂呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我晝夜以淚為食，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們整天譏笑我：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你的上帝在哪裡？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從前我與眾人同行，帶領大家去上帝的殿，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在歡呼、感恩聲中一起過節。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我回想這些事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中無限憂傷。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何沮喪？為何在我裡面煩躁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要仰望上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我還要讚美祂——我的救主，我的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我的上帝啊，我心中沮喪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便在約旦之地、黑門山和米薩山想起你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的瀑布發出巨響，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"迴盪在深淵之間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的洪濤巨浪淹沒我。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"白天耶和華將祂的慈愛澆灌我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"夜間我歌頌祂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向賜我生命的上帝禱告。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我對我的磐石上帝說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你為何忘記我？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"為何要我受仇敵的攻擊，使我哀傷不已呢？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仇敵的辱罵刺骨鑽心。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們整天對我說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「你的上帝在哪裡？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你為何沮喪？為何在我裡面煩躁？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要仰望上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我還要讚美祂——我的救主，我的上帝。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/42.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/43.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/41.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}